"\"Peripheral\". A dashed line near the top\n"
"labelled \"BLE connection open (unencrypted)\".\n"
"Below it, three arrows: \"pairing request\" from\n"
"central to peripheral, \"key exchange\" both\n"
"directions, \"pairing complete\" forward. A\n"
"second dashed line below labelled \"link\n"
"encrypted\". Two thick bidirectional arrows\n"
"carry \"encrypted GATT traffic\". An optional\n"
"\"store keys to flash\" box on the side, labelled\n"
"\"bonding\"."
msgstr ""
"Dua kolom berlabel \"Central\" dan\n"
"\"Peripheral\". Garis putus-putus di bagian atas\n"
"berlabel \"Koneksi BLE terbuka (tidak terenkripsi)\".\n"
"Di bawahnya, tiga panah: \"permintaan pairing\" dari\n"
"central ke peripheral, \"pertukaran kunci\" dua\n"
"arah, \"pairing selesai\" ke depan. Garis putus-putus\n"
"kedua di bawah berlabel \"link\n"
"terenkripsi\". Dua panah dua arah tebal\n"
"membawa \"lalu lintas GATT terenkripsi\". Kotak opsional\n"
